# Stage-1 CELL009 (15-95%) set (2026-10-04) = stage1_v4a + the CELL009 deviations
# (run S1n_CELL009_pos_n50_b120_crack1.1e4_w1e-3): Si crack mult 1.1e4 (shared 1e3),
# width 1e-3 (25 degC shared 5e-3). The cathode x0.3 patch is gone (shared law), but
# LAM_PE overshoots: 7.5% vs real 4.8% at EFC 402. Mean SoH gap 2.2pp.
#   ./run.sh TAG 25p1595 $(grep -v '^#' stage1_v4a_CELL009.env | xargs)
